    {
      "id": "claim_c34ccaa3227b40098250b4d3da502036",
      "statement": "Memory shedding is a pure classifier over a sampled measurement plus the prior latch; residency is deliberately excluded because it is a hard cap enforced at admission, and conflating the two previously produced placement churn and an admission wedge.",
