    {
      "id": "claim_e5a95d5ab3384c68a757ff220cc32744",
      "statement": "The fleet drain token and first-readiness gate policy are advisory: a donor that cannot claim the token proceeds after a bounded wait, and every failure path degrades to the pre-token serialized-free behavior, never to something worse.",
